<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68231" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνοΐα</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνωΐα</span></b> , 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνῴα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a class of
			serfs</i> or <i>vassals</i>, in Crete, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Scol.</u>
				28.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sosicr.Hist.
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνοΐτης</span></b> , also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνωΐτης</span></b> , 
				contr.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνῴτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <i>Cretan
				serf</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermon
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				6.267c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.83
			</span></i>. (Cogn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δμώς</span>, cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσόμνη</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσόδμη</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
